OAuth 2 in Action, Rust edition
https://github.com/zuhaib786/oauth2-in-action-rust

This project is a Rust port of the exercises from "OAuth 2 in Action"
by Justin Richer and Antonio Sanso:
https://github.com/oauthinaction/oauth-in-action-code

That code is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The HTML
templates and the structure of the exercises in this project are adapted
from it. The Rust code is a new implementation.
